## 9) Endpoints principais (MVP)

### Auth (JWT)

- `POST /api/auth/register/`
- `POST /api/auth/login/`
- `POST /api/auth/refresh/`
- `GET /api/auth/me/`

### Processos

- `GET /api/process-types/`
- `GET /api/required-documents/`
- `GET|POST /api/requests/`
- `GET|PATCH|DELETE /api/requests/{id}/`
- `PATCH /api/requests/{id}/update-status/` (somente advogado)
- `GET|POST /api/documents/`
- `GET|PATCH|DELETE /api/documents/{id}/`

